mapping "W2459.1" source="W2459" target="269716005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2459 SNOMED CT 269716005 = Swedish national extension subcode of ICD-10 W24 (Contact with
        lifting and transmission device(s), not elsewhere classified), further specifying place/activity
        (e.g. industrial site, agricultural area, shop/service area, sports, leisure, work, vital
        activities). Target SNOMED CT 432534 (concept_code 269716005) = the parent W24 maps to it via the
        Athena ICD10->SNOMED CT crosswalk (relationship row 45756277 -> 432534). The Swedish subcodes
        encode place/activity granularity that has no standard SNOMED CT analogue; the crosswalk target is
        the only defensible standard concept and legitimately subsumes all subcodes (broader).
        Confidence (moderate): parent-level crosswalk verified, but the Swedish extension subcode adds
        granularity the target cannot reflect, and the crosswalk was not independently re-verified at
        this subcode.
        """
}
